# Built-in Code-OSS extensions the Studio keeps; every other one is left out.
# An allowlist, so an extension upstream adds later is out until someone adds it here.
# Dev mode disables the rest with --disable-extension (scripts/dev-launch.sh); packaging leaves them out.
vscode.theme-defaults
vscode.vscode-theme-seti
vscode.configuration-editing
vscode.json
vscode.json-language-features
vscode.yaml
vscode.markdown
vscode.markdown-language-features
vscode.search-result
vscode.log
